      "aptab*/lattab*/aplattab*": [
        "measured_dimension_cm",
        "effective_diameter_cm",
        "conversion_factor"
      ]
    },
    "note": "aptab/lattab/aplattab map a single measured dimension (AP, lateral, or the AP+lateral sum, in cm) to the population-mean effective diameter and the corresponding conversion factor. The reference implementation reads column 2 as the effective diameter and column 3 as the factor; column 3 agrees with etab* evaluated at column 2, which the test suite checks."
